  "description": "Villa Golds is an exceptional luxury property situated in the prestigious Marbella Golden Mile, offering an unparalleled location just moments from the beach, Marbella town centre, and the renowned Puerto Banús. Designed for those seeking the highest standards of comfort and exclusivity, this remarkable villa provides the perfect setting to experience the very best of the Costa del Sol.\n\nThe villa features seven spacious bedrooms, the majority of which are en-suite, ensuring privacy and comfort for all guests. In addition, there are two dedicated staff rooms, providing convenient accommodation for household personnel.\n\nThe outdoor areas have been thoughtfully designed to create a private oasis, complete with beautifully landscaped gardens, a stunning private swimming pool, and generous terraces ideal for relaxing or entertaining. The wellness facilities are equally impressive, featuring an indoor heated pool, a luxurious Jacuzzi, and a sauna, creating a true spa-like retreat within the home.\n\nThe elegant living spaces are enhanced by a fireplace, double glazing, and floor-to-ceiling glass doors that open onto private terraces with beautiful mountain views. Modern comforts include high-speed Wi-Fi, a laundry room, and an advanced alarm system for complete peace of mind. A dedicated barbecue area provides the perfect setting for al fresco dining and gatherings with family and friends.\n\nIdeally located in one of Marbella's most sought-after areas, the villa enjoys immediate proximity to the beach, the sea, Puerto Banús, Marbella town centre, shops, restaurants, and all essential amenities. Combining privacy, luxury, and convenience, Villa Golds offers an exceptional lifestyle in one of the Costa del Sol's most exclusive locations.\n\n**Key Features**\n\n* 7 spacious bedrooms, predominantly en-suite\n\n* 2 staff rooms\n\n* Private outdoor swimming pool\n\n* Indoor heated swimming pool\n\n* Jacuzzi and sauna\n\n* Beautifully landscaped private garden\n\n* Private garage with space for up to 5 vehicles\n\n* Fireplace\n\n* Double glazing\n\n* Private terraces with mountain views\n\n* Barbecue area\n\n* High-speed Wi-Fi\n\n* Advanced alarm system\n\n* South-facing orientation\n\n* Single-level layout\n\nPlease note that we welcome families and couples only. We do not accept groups under the age of 30, stag parties, or hen parties. If your group falls outside these criteria, please send us an enquiry with some information about yourselves and the purpose of your stay, and we will be happy to present your request to the owner for consideration.\n\nDon't forget to ask about our concierge services. We look forward to welcoming you to Marbella.",
